WEBVTT

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:15.200
<b><i>Planet With</i></b>

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:34.570
<b>Episode 7: Sirius</b>

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.170
I'm home.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:45.300
How you feelin', Sensei?

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:48.520
I see.

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:52.950
Soya-kun hasn't left his bed 
since that battle, either.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.360
I wonder if he's okay.

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:13.590
The enemy's coming!

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.030
Get behind me!

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:16.150
P-Princess!

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.620
So that's the Princess of Riel, huh?

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:24.450
She seems to have some degree 
of psychokinetic power.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:25.640
Don't worry.

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:28.260
She's no match for us Siriusians.

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:35.000
You think that's going to stop us?

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:43.930
What is that?

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.410
What the hell?

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.780
Some new Rielian weapon?

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:05.080
Our psychokinesis isn't working!

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.310
Stop! We're retreating!

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:12.710
Why? Riel's princess is right there!

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.530
W-We've gotten news that our home planet

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:18.550
is under attack by a giant d-dragon!

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.830
A dragon?

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:22.260
Everyone's been ordered to 
meet up with the main army!

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.390
Thank you for saving me!

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.730
Um... who are you?

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.230
I am with Nebula!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.530
Nebula... <i>the</i> Nebula?

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:40.030
Yes, the space government formed by
species that chose the evolution of love.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:42.490
I'm so glad... Riel is saved!

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.270
You're okay here, right?

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.450
I must hurry!

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.290
Um... Where are you going?

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:52.330
The dragon is attacking Siriusian civilians!

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.430
I have to stop it!

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.670
Wait!

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:59.280
Take me!

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.630
Princess, what are you—

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:02.430
You're sure?

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:06.300
I'm going to save Sirius,
 which attacked your people.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:10.690
Yes! Let me learn from you,

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:13.470
so I can be ready when the time 
comes for Riel to join Nebula!

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:15.060
Please!

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:16.900
All right.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.110
Get in.

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:23.200
We're getting back before 
the Siriusian army does.

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:26.370
Um, are you leaving your ship?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.390
Yeah.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.660
Once that thing lands,
 it can't move for a while.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:34.520
So I need a boost if I'm 
going to get there on my own.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:37.130
You're going to have to share 
in the hangover. I'm sorry.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:38.570
I don't care.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:42.460
There should be a gate nearby 
that the Siriusians used.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:45.840
If we go through that,
we should get there in no time.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:46.430
Right.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.640
<i>Hey. Where are you going?</i>

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.850
The dragon's gone to the 
Siriusians' home planet, right?

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:55.030
Don't tell me you're going to stop it.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:57.350
<i>I'm the only one who can make it in time.</i>

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:59.240
<i>Listen.</i>

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:03.440
<i>When we got information about 
the Siriusian invasion of Riel,</i>

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:07.570
<i>the dragon left, screaming that
 it would bring down</i>

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.700
<i>the hammer of justice upon evil.</i>

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:13.660
His righteous anger has caused 
him to forget himself.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:16.180
<i>I'm going to stop him, even if that's true!</i>

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:19.260
The dragon's martial force is 
the strongest in the universe.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:21.130
What can you do alone?

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:23.520
The dragon may destroy the 
entire Siriusian army...

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:27.030
No, their entire race!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:31.140
And when that's done, he'll be put to death!

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.730
I want to save both the 
dragon and the Siriusians!

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:36.840
<i>Can we truly call Nebula</i>

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:40.400
<i>the space government formed by species
that chose the evolution of love if we don't?</i>

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:45.690
It is the fate of the dragon 
and the Siriusians. Give up.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.810
Fate is just a result.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.570
It's something you talk about after 
you've done everything you can!

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:55.120
I'm just going to do something 
I feel I have to do!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.750
<i>Stubborn, aren't you? Well, do as you please.</i>

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.420
<i>Don't die, at least.</i>

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:06.490
Nothing on radar nearby.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:09.180
Good. Looks like the 
Siriusians aren't here yet.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.180
That's Planet Sirius!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.470
That's it?

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:14.810
What's wrong?

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.920
I can hear screams from Planet Sirius!

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:21.190
You're a telepath?

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:25.290
Just keep the door to 
your mind tightly closed!

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.510
The Siriusians are strong enough psychics

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:29.860
that you can hear their thoughts from here!

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.710
It's dangerous to expose yourself 
to billions of voices at once!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:34.700
No...

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:40.330
If I follow the screams, I can tell you 
where the dragon is attacking now.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.520
Don't try it. Your synapses will burn out!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.020
Civilians are trying to protect their town.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:49.570
No!

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.430
Got it! Protect your mind!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:05.590
Is that it?

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:07.280
The dragon!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:19.160
That?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.000
It's so big.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.440
The planet...

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:29.090
All those lives are...

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:35.610
Everyone's already...

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:38.970
Look! Over there!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:39.890
What?

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.070
I'll save him!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.550
A child?

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:48.210
He's in a precarious state,

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:48.900
but he's breathing.

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:51.250
Take care of him!

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:51.920
Right!

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:56.950
No luck.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.160
There's no place to put him down.

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.120
The whole surface is...

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:03.860
I have to follow the dragon!

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.000
What's that light?

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.200
Where the dragon went.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.090
Don't tell me...

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.760
It's the Siriusian fleet!

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:44.130
The dragon's destroying the 
Siriusian fleet that returned here.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:46.930
Everyone's already...

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.970
Dragon! Why did you do this?

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:57.570
Are you the Kigurumian who just flew by me?

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.810
I guess I wasn't imagining it, then.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:04.900
I simply destroyed an evil race.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.980
I meted out justice!

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.570
And destroyed innocent civilians as well?

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:12.990
There are no "civilians" in an evil race!

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:19.660
And I sense a Siriusian within you, too.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:21.580
Give it to me.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.090
I'll end their race here!

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.920
I will take this child in and raise him.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:32.170
And the man he becomes will prove it!

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.090
Prove it? Prove what?

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:38.340
That love exists within him as well!

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:43.600
That the Siriusians could have become a 
race of the evolution of love, too!

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:46.570
I'll prove that what your 
sense of justice killed

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:50.020
was a race whose future
 was the evolution of love!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.070
What?

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:52.160
Dragon!

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:54.970
Never commit another massacre 
in the name of justice!

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:56.860
That's true evil!

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:00.630
We forgive, accept, and watch over them!

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:02.870
That is what Nebula does, as races
 who chose the evolution of love!

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:07.740
Are you saying I don't belong in Nebula?

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:08.870
I am!

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.170
Look!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:15.300
You destroyed plants, animals,
 and innocent lives!

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:19.940
So you're calling me an evil murderer?

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.320
You're calling <i>me</i> that?

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:23.220
<i>Enough, dragon.</i>

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:34.860
You're under arrest.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.240
Destroying an entire planet 
is a serious crime.

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:39.370
I'm...

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:40.200
Silence!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.710
I'm...

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:51.520
Telepaths, lower the dragon's 
consciousness level!

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.930
<i>What will happen to the dragon?</i>

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:36.500
He'll be the first execution 
in Nebula's history, I'm sure.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:38.150
That's not what needs to happen!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:42.120
If I can prove that even the 
Siriusians are capable of love,

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:43.970
the dragon will change his mind.

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.810
Give up.

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:50.600
I didn't make it in time.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:54.710
I couldn't save the Siriusians...

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:56.950
...or the dragon.

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:01.150
You saved this child and me.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:03.700
You're a true hero!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:12.850
That was a dream, huh?

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:16.960
Think you can go to school today?

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.130
Yeah.

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.960
I see. I made you lunch.

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:22.470
Meatless meat and potatoes.

00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:25.180
That's just... potatoes.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:29.830
I put in some shirataki noodles, carrots, 
and onions, all in a sweet sauce!

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:30.680
It's good!

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:32.150
I see.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:36.440
You know, you finally admitted you're 
taking the meat out deliberately.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:39.410
Do Rielians not eat meat?

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:40.900
We don't.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:44.150
Wait, did I tell you I was a Rielian?

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.060
Yeah, I heard.

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.770
Huh?

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:50.000
Thanks for the food.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:00.840
Good morning, Sensei.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:02.800
See you later.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.180
Don't push yourself too hard, Sensei.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.300
I know I'm the one who 
made you do that, though.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:18.940
Kuroi-kun!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.030
Morning.

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.070
Good morning!

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.410
It feels like there's less people.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:32.930
Everybody moved away while you
 were staying home from school.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.670
What happened was really crazy...

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:38.980
I see.

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:42.570
I'm glad you stayed though, Nozo-san.

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:46.790
Think they'll close the school?

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.140
I don't know.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.020
It's over.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:02.350
<i>I did it, Brother.</i>

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:09.070
<i>What was that guy's deal, anyway?</i>

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:11.530
<i>He turned to sand at the end of it...</i>

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:14.890
<i>Does that mean I killed somebody?</i>

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:18.710
<i>Wow. It doesn't feel real at all.</i>

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.230
<i>I mean, he turned into sand.</i>

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:23.420
<i>Is that usually how people die?</i>

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:28.480
<i>I thought I'd be happier.</i>

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:30.510
Hello!

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.560
Hello!

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:39.270
I'm sorry! Hello!

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:40.860
Wow!

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:42.560
What was that? It was so cool!

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.740
Y-Yeah?

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:48.780
By the way, Kuroi-kun,
 what are you doing up here?

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.570
You were supposed to show me 
around after school, right?

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:53.580
I was?

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.410
We've only just met.

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:57.100
Did we?

00:14:57.100 --> 00:15:00.290
Come on, try and remember me.

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:05.800
I'm Kogane Shiraishi. I just 
transferred into your class today.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.380
Shiraishi?

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:09.260
Huh?

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:11.640
Sorry, Shiraishi-san.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.700
How did I forget?

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.430
No, it's fine.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.600
Let's go, then.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:21.090
Where's the gym storeroom?

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.150
It's next to the gym. Why?

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:26.070
Kuroi-kun!

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:28.070
Are you coming to...

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.860
Oh, Nozo-san.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:30.610
Oh.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:35.330
Kuroi-kun!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.750
Uh, who's this?

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:42.390
Remember? I'm Kogane Shiraishi. 
I transferred here today,

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.830
Nozomi Takamagahara-san.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:48.960
Kuroi-kun said he'd show 
me around after school.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.840
Huh? We didn't get any
 transfer students today.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.300
And, um...

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:59.810
You're wearing our uniform, 
but are you really a student?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.770
What are you talking about, Nozo-san?

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:04.730
Does it not work on her?

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:08.190
Does what not work?

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.990
Oops! I forgot that my mom 
asked me to run an errand.

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:14.860
Bye, Kuroi-kun!

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.010
See you later!

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:26.380
Hey, who was that?

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:30.170
I-Is that the type of girl you like?

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:31.220
No, um...

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:34.720
She was kind of cute.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:35.860
Cu...

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:42.850
Let's go to the club room.

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.690
<b>Occult Research</b>

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:55.610
Kuroi-kun, are you okay?

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.830
You've been out of it all day.

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:03.040
Are you thinking about her?

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.510
Um... Shiraishi-san?

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:07.330
No.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:11.170
Just, a lot of things have ended, 
and I'm feeling burnt out.

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:18.640
Is the battle with the aliens... over?

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:21.820
Did it end in that big fight
 that just happened?

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.600
Yeah, I guess.

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:29.310
I see!

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.530
Um, listen...

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:34.590
After school tomorrow, 
do you want to go hang out?

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:35.320
Hang out?

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:37.600
Like a celebration...

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:40.910
Or a thank you for saving the city...

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:42.380
The city?

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.650
Okay, I'll be going!

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:47.020
See you tomorrow!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.010
Hey.

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:00.600
You look down.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.930
You know your battle isn't over, right?

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.520
Brother?

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.230
That's how I look to you, huh?

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:13.450
Sorry, but I'm not your brother.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:17.450
You're the one who was there 
when I beat that old guy!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.240
I thought I was imagining things.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:21.480
Who are you?

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.330
Why do you look like my brother?

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.150
We are the People of Paradise...

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.740
The oldest race in the universe.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:34.340
This form is simply how you're 
perceiving us. We play no part in it.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:39.760
We have no material forms,
 and so take no specific appearance.

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:41.520
Paradise?

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:42.930
I don't know what you're talking about,

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:46.600
but stop looking like my brother!

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:51.830
There's no need to be surprised 
when you're the one that did it.

00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:55.380
Your psychic powers have already awoken.

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:56.740
Psychic?

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:59.140
I wanted to ask a favor from you,

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.870
but I'll wait until another time.

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:05.480
And this form isn't one I chose to take.

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:06.720
But...

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:09.760
Well, we can talk another time.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:10.620
Bye.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.770
Huh?

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:16.510
Hey! Where did you go?

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.760
What did you mean, my battle isn't over?

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:20.910
What were you doing there?

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.340
Why are you my brother?

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.050
Stop hiding and come out!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.280
You found me.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.550
Hello, Kuroi-kun.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.130
Sh-Shiraishi-san?

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:39.500
What are you doing here?

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.190
Watching.

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:42.870
Watching?

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:46.200
By the way, who were you 
talking with just now?

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.160
Um... I don't know myself.

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:54.490
It looked to me like you 
were talking to empty air...

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:57.910
<i>Only I could see him?</i>

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:01.510
I was just talking to myself, that's all.

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:03.310
Who are those two, by the way?

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.720
Forget you saw me here.

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:11.270
See you at school.

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:14.810
Sorry, Senpai.

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:18.540
Oh, you stopped my telepathy.

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:19.820
You've improved, have you?

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.360
Aw...

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.410
But don't call me "Senpai."

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:26.580
But you are...

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:29.660
By the way, what's with the outfit?

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:35.310
I suggested she be a teacher, myself.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.130
You, too? Traitor!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.090
I am a traitor. Toward humanity.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.580
I'm sorry, Nebula Soldier.

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:46.800
I'm joining the Sealing Faction.

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:48.850
I knew it!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.590
You were with the Earth defense.

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:51.180
Why?

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.130
S-Sorry...

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:56.690
But I don't want Earth 
to end up like Sirius.

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:03.780
The mental maturation rate of Siriusians 
was very similar to that of Earthlings.

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:06.760
If Earthlings awaken their 
psychic powers as well,

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:10.740
they'll begin to militarize 
just like Sirius did.

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:15.000
And then they'll invade other planets in 
search of resources and entertainment.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.750
Just as Sirius did to Riel.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:21.860
All people need to awaken to 
their powers is the right opportunity.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:23.920
Just like you and I did.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:28.680
We should seal our evolution 
before that happens.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:31.350
And so, we're declaring war.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.580
Takashi Ryuzoji is gone,

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:37.790
and only we Sealing Faction 
and you Pacifists remain.

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:42.370
Let us have a fair fight to 
determine the future of humanity!

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:45.900
That will be all for today.

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:47.780
Farewell!

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.300
They left.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.560
I'm not doing it.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:03.590
I'm not fighting.

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:05.670
It's not my problem.

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:09.970
<b><i>To Be Continued</i></b>

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:45.080
<b><i>Next Time
 Power Is What Dwells
Within Your Own Self</i></b>
